    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a pan located on the top side. To the left of the pan, there is a drill situated on the left side of the image, and a plate is aligned vertically with the drill. For every fork in the scene, the pan is positioned above it. Furthermore, each fork is accompanied by a sock located above it, a game controller aligned vertically with it, and a phone that is smaller than the fork.",
